@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-35 - Update Fulfillment Status

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-35
FE -> API: PATCH /payments/orders/:orderCode/fulfillment
API -> Service: Execute Update Fulfillment Status
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Fulfillment status được cập nhật

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Status transition không hợp lệ -> 400
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đơn hàng tồn tại
Post: Fulfillment status được cập nhật
Main flow:
1. Admin mở chi tiết đơn hàng
2. Admin chọn status mới: CONFIRMED -> PACKING -> SHIPPING -> DELIVERED
3. Nếu chọn SHIPPING: nhập carrier + trackingCode
4. Admin thêm note (optional)
5. System gọi API PATCH /payments/orders/:orderCode/fulfillment
6. System cập nhật fulfillmentStatus, thêm vào statusHistory[]
7. System gửi email thông báo cho khách hàng
end note
@enduml
